*.err
/tmp/
# Build output: the .plg is committed (its version stamp is frozen at the tag),
# but the .tgz package is rebuilt reproducibly by CI at publish — never committed.
/ci-runner-farm.tgz

# Local session logs (save-to-md / quick-push notes) — dev artifacts, never committed.
docs/sessions/
build/

# Distributed controller / node build output.
/target/
/target-*/
/controller/_build/
/controller/deps/
/controller/cover/
/controller/.elixir_ls/
/controller/erl_crash.dump

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/
# Ignore the whole local beads database in this PUBLIC repository. Until now it
# was ignored only by a machine-global git rule, which does not travel with the
# repo; .beads/.gitignore covers the Dolt internals but not interactions.jsonl,
# backup/ or config.yaml. Beads sync uses refs/dolt/data, not tracked files.
.beads/
